# Counter-example: an anchor missing its offset space (fires lang:UnanchoredOffset / shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent).

@prefix lang: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/lang/> .

ex:doc a lang:SignSystem .
ex:anc a lang:SurfaceAnchor ; lang:anchorSource ex:doc ; lang:anchorStart 0 ; lang:anchorEnd 5 .
